  "plain": "In 1948, in Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, a preacher named Solon Brown is said to have been asked to pray over the bodies of beings found in a crashed saucer. He answered, \"Well, I'm not Catholic. I'm a Baptist preacher, but I'd be more than happy to say a prayer over him.\" Scott Ramsey passes on Brown's words as they were told to him, as part of the case for a crash with bodies at Aztec."
